sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agent A
  participant L as target task lock
  participant F as task JSON
  participant D as dependency files
  A->>F: existence check
  A->>L: acquire target lock
  A->>F: re-read target
  A->>A: owner/completed check
  A->>D: list unresolved blockers
  A->>F: updateTaskUnsafe(owner=A)
  A->>L: release
